{"id":31608,"date":"2025-08-14T14:06:40","date_gmt":"2025-08-14T14:06:40","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/dailyglobal.info\/starvation-warning-in-war-torn-sudan-bbc-news\/"},"modified":"2025-08-14T14:06:40","modified_gmt":"2025-08-14T14:06:40","slug":"starvation-warning-in-war-torn-sudan-bbc-news","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/dailyglobal.info\/starvation-warning-in-war-torn-sudan-bbc-news\/","title":{"rendered":"Starvation warning in war-torn Sudan | BBC News"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>International aid organisations have intensified their warnings over starvation in Sudan.<\/p>\n<p>Sudan was plunged into a civil war in April 2023 <!--more--> after a vicious power struggle erupted between the army and its former ally, the Rapid Support Forces (RSF) &#8211; creating one of the world&#8217;s worst humanitarian crises.<\/p>\n<p>The World Food Programme said it had not been able to deliver food to the city in the western Darfur region by road for more than a year.<\/p>\n<p>The city of El-Fasher has been surrounded by paramilitary fighters from the RSF for nearly 16 months &#8211; determined to seize it from Sudan&#8217;s army.<\/p>\n<p>Local activists have already begun reporting deaths by starvation in the city, which is still home to about 300,000 people.<\/p>\n<p>Subscribe here: <a href=\"http:\/\/bit.ly\/1rbfUog\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">http:\/\/bit.ly\/1rbfUog<\/a><\/p>\n<p>For more news, analysis and features visit: www.bbc.com\/news <\/p>\n<p>#Sudan #BBCNews<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>International aid organisations have intensified their warnings over starvation in Sudan. Sudan was plunged into a civil war in April 2023<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":31627,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_exactmetrics_skip_tracking":false,"_exactmetrics_sitenote_active":false,"_exactmetrics_sitenote_note":"","_exactmetrics_site